SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Rincian Harta Kekayaan Presiden Jokowi yang Naik Rp 7,8 Miliar Selama 2021","publisher":"Kompas.com","publication_date":"2022-04-24","url":"https://www.kompas.com/wiken/read/2022/04/24/060000981/rincian-harta-kekayaan-presiden-jokowi-yang-naik-rp-7-8-miliar-selama-2021?page=all","claim":"Kompas reported that Jokowi filed his LHKPN on 24 February 2022, disclosing total assets of Rp71.47 billion for the 2021 reporting period, up from the prior year.","locator":"article body, opening wealth-summary paragraphs","source_type":"media","source_confidence":"medium_high","source_confidence_reason":"Secondary reporting on a public asset declaration with concrete figures and filing date.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly within the 2022 period, based on a filing made in February 2022 and reported in April 2022.","ruler_attribution":"Directly attributable to Jokowi as a public disclosure of his own assets; not an external audit.","contrary_evidence":["Self-reporting is not independent proof of honesty beyond compliance.","The article does not test source-of-wealth legitimacy or undisclosed conflicts."],"lenses":["7B.6","7B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Two Newly-Inaugurated Ministers Have Excellent Track Records, President Jokowi Says","publisher":"Sekretariat Kabinet Republik Indonesia","publication_date":"2022-06-15","url":"https://setkab.go.id/en/two-newly-inaugurated-ministers-have-excellent-track-records-president-jokowi-says/","claim":"Jokowi said the 15 June 2022 ministerial appointments were based on track record, experience, and managerial skills, and he publicly explained why he chose Zulkifli Hasan and Hadi Tjahjanto.","locator":"opening paragraphs and the quoted explanation of appointment criteria","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Direct presidential-secretariat transcript of the president’s stated justification for appointments.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Direct 2022 appointment decision.","ruler_attribution":"Directly attributable to Jokowi as the appointing president.","contrary_evidence":["The source is the president’s own explanation, so it is self-justifying.","Independent reporting in the same week argued the reshuffle was political and coalition-driven."],"lenses":["7B.5","7B.9"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Reshuffle helps coalition close ranks ahead of polls","publisher":"The Jakarta Post","publication_date":"2022-06-16","url":"https://www.thejakartapost.com/paper/2022/06/16/reshuffle-helps-coalition-close-ranks-ahead-of-polls.html","claim":"The Jakarta Post reported that analysts saw Jokowi’s June 2022 reshuffle as a way to keep the coalition unified and install more loyalists, with the palace using the event to show there were no fractures in the ruling bloc.","locator":"middle paragraphs describing analyst assessments and coalition dynamics","source_type":"media","source_confidence":"medium_high","source_confidence_reason":"Contemporaneous reporting with named analysts and direct quotes, but still interpretive.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly within 2022.","ruler_attribution":"Attributable to Jokowi’s cabinet choices and coalition management.","contrary_evidence":["Analyst interpretation is not a legal finding of self-dealing.","The article also notes the reshuffle’s stated public-utility rationale."],"lenses":["7B.5","7B.9"]}
